{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \widctlpar \f4\fs20 {\f5\cf4 Commander:
\par 
\par Our Eden "guests" have been convinced to contribute their efforts to our cause.
\par 
\par Still, it may not be enough.  Our Council has made an offer to Eden to exchange our Gene Bank for more of their starship technology.
\par 
\par They have not replied.
\par 
\par Information from the Eden scientists indicates that New Terra does not have enough uncontaminated resources left to complete two starships.  
\par 
\par We expect Eden to make a rescue attempt or perhaps attempt to steal our Gene Bank and halt our starship progress.  These assets must be protected.
\par 
\par We must also launch more starship components into orbit and protect our Labs and Spaceport.  Our latest weapons system, inspired by a chapter of Earth history, may help our defenses against Eden\rquote s advanced weaponry.
\par 
\par These new weapons are powerful self-destruct turrets.  They will destroy any lightly armored units near them and do great damage to even heavily armored units.
\par 
\par But obviously they can only be used one time for each unit.  A high return for a high price.
\par 
\par New defensive weapons projects have been proposed by our scientists as well.  Explore as many of these as you can while balancing the other needs of the colony.
\par 
\par Our starship program must stay on schedule.  Consult the Specific Objectives list for what we must do to survive.
\par 
\par }}